    {
      "id": "ch1",
      "title": "第 1 章 测试结论",
      "blocks": [],
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "s1-1",
          "title": "1.1 测试结论摘要",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "TDSQL-B-v22.7.2 的 sysbench OLTP 日志包含 5 个场景、6 个并发档，共 30 条记录。日志声明每项测试时长 300s，测试开始时间为 2026-06-10 14:00:00。五个场景的已测 QPS 峰值均出现在 512 并发，1000 并发时吞吐均有所回落且 P95、P99 上升；各场景分别分析，不合并为平均性能。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s1-2",
          "title": "1.2 关键性能数字",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "场景",
                "峰值并发",
                "峰值 TPS",
                "峰值 QPS",
                "P95@峰值 (ms)"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "点查",
                  "512",
                  "78,230.60",
                  "78,230.60",
                  "8.90"
                ],
                [
                  "只读",
                  "512",
                  "3,380.20",
                  "47,322.80",
                  "158.40"
                ],
                [
                  "混合读写",
                  "512",
                  "2,180.30",
                  "43,606.00",
                  "248.20"
                ],
                [
                  "索引更新",
                  "512",
                  "13,250.40",
                  "13,250.40",
                  "42.80"
                ],
                [
                  "写入",
                  "512",
                  "20,120.80",
                  "60,362.40",
                  "32.50"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "path": "charts/single_peak_summary.png",
              "caption": "图：TDSQL-B-v22.7.2 各场景峰值 QPS。不同场景的事务工作量不同，图中数值不代表场景优劣。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s1-3",
          "title": "1.3 核心结论",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "level": "L1",
              "text": "点查（oltp_point_select）：并发 32→512，QPS 18,420.50→78,230.60（4.25 倍）；在已测档位中峰值位于 512 并发。1000 并发 QPS 为 75,100.20，较峰值下降 4.00%；P95 从 2.10ms 增至 18.20ms，P99 从 3.40ms 增至 32.10ms。 数据来源：data/single.log；extracted_data.records[scenario=oltp_point_select]",
              "scenario": "oltp_point_select",
              "source": "data/single.log；extracted_data.records[scenario=oltp_point_select]",
              "type": "insight"
            },
            {
              "level": "L1",
              "text": "只读（oltp_read_only）：并发 32→512，QPS 11,484.20→47,322.80（4.12 倍）；在已测档位中峰值位于 512 并发。1000 并发 QPS 为 45,088.40，较峰值下降 4.72%；P95 从 42.10ms 增至 320.10ms，P99 从 58.30ms 增至 458.20ms。 数据来源：data/single.log；extracted_data.records[scenario=oltp_read_only]",
              "scenario": "oltp_read_only",
              "source": "data/single.log；extracted_data.records[scenario=oltp_read_only]",
              "type": "insight"
            },
            {
              "level": "L1",
              "text": "混合读写（oltp_read_write）：并发 32→512，QPS 10,408.00→43,606.00（4.19 倍）；在已测档位中峰值位于 512 并发。1000 并发 QPS 为 41,016.00，较峰值下降 5.94%；P95 从 72.30ms 增至 512.30ms，P99 从 98.50ms 增至 748.40ms。 数据来源：data/single.log；extracted_data.records[scenario=oltp_read_write]",
              "scenario": "oltp_read_write",
              "source": "data/single.log；extracted_data.records[scenario=oltp_read_write]",
              "type": "insight"
            },
            {
              "level": "L1",
              "text": "索引更新（oltp_update_index）：并发 32→512，QPS 3,120.50→13,250.40（4.25 倍）；在已测档位中峰值位于 512 并发。1000 并发 QPS 为 12,820.10，较峰值下降 3.25%；P95 从 12.80ms 增至 88.40ms，P99 从 20.40ms 增至 152.30ms。 数据来源：data/single.log；extracted_data.records[scenario=oltp_update_index]",
              "scenario": "oltp_update_index",
              "source": "data/single.log；extracted_data.records[scenario=oltp_update_index]",
              "type": "insight"
            },
            {
              "level": "L1",
              "text": "写入（oltp_write_only）：并发 32→512，QPS 14,460.30→60,362.40（4.17 倍）；在已测档位中峰值位于 512 并发。1000 并发 QPS 为 58,741.20，较峰值下降 2.69%；P95 从 8.40ms 增至 68.40ms，P99 从 14.20ms 增至 124.30ms。 数据来源：data/single.log；extracted_data.records[scenario=oltp_write_only]",
              "scenario": "oltp_write_only",
              "source": "data/single.log；extracted_data.records[scenario=oltp_write_only]",
              "type": "insight"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
